<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 267.51 million rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Nov 8   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		     4,354.67     149,971.09</p>
<p>    - sales			   4,087.15     147,654.23</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)	 267.51	 2,316.86</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
